{
  "description": "AKAC 0.6 release and retrieval protection vectors (ADR-020, spec/AKAC-0.6.md). Synthetic data. Kinds: obligations (parseObligations), reason (classify), release (openContext then release with configured release filters), derive (openContext then derive with configured sanitizers), hint (the same denied request for each resource with hints requested; every answer carries the expected hint, null for none), volume (consecutive openContext calls under a volume budget), cache (evaluate and revoke steps with the in-process decision cache on). Filter and sanitizer behaviours: pass, redact, clean, deny, throw, hang (no answer within the hook deadline), invalid (malformed result), grow (a redaction beyond the growth bound). Patches as in vectors.json.",
